body.zh-TW:
讓 Claude Code 在沙盒（sandbox，隔離程式執行的安全環境）裡跑 Bash 指令時，過去會自動放行，現在預設依一般權限流程處理。⟦就像住進保全升級的大樓後，自家陽台施工也改走一般管理流程，想恢復免問直接動工得另外簽同意書。⟧

想維持原本不詢問就自動執行的做法，可以在設定檔加上：

```json
{
  "sandbox": {
    "autoAllowBashIfSandboxed": true
  }
}
```

如果是公司用統一管理設定開啟沙盒，這行開關必須寫在優先權最高的管理設定來源裡才會生效。

body.en:
When Claude Code runs Bash commands inside a sandbox (an isolated security environment for running code), they used to pass automatically, but now they follow the normal permission flow by default. ⟦Moving into a building with upgraded security means even work on your own balcony goes through standard management approval, and skipping that check requires signing a separate consent form.⟧

To keep the previous behavior of running without prompts, add this to your settings file:

```json
{
  "sandbox": {
    "autoAllowBashIfSandboxed": true
  }
}
```

If your organization enables the sandbox through managed settings, this toggle must be placed in your highest-ranking managed settings source to take effect.

body.zh-TW:
剛請 Claude 在 VS Code 改完一段程式、正猶豫下一步要補測試還是看差異時，現在輸入框會同步浮現終端機版原本就有的提示建議讓你參考。⟦好像寫信時游標旁自動浮出淡灰色的接續草稿，想照著送出就輕敲跳格鍵採納，嫌干擾也能隨時關掉。⟧你只要按下 `Tab` 鍵就能直接採用這段建議；若想關閉，在 Claude Code 的 `settings.json` 加上這行設定即可：

```json
{
  "promptSuggestionEnabled": false
}
```

body.en:
Right after asking Claude to edit code in VS Code and wondering whether to add tests or check the diff next, the input box now shows the same prompt suggestions already available in the terminal. ⟦Faint gray continuation text appears beside your cursor while writing an email, ready to send with a light tap of the Tab key or turn off anytime if it gets in the way.⟧ Just press `Tab` to accept the suggestion; to turn it off, add this line to Claude Code's `settings.json`:

```json
{
  "promptSuggestionEnabled": false
}
```

body.zh-TW:
開著長任務反覆檢查進度時，硬碟裡常不知不覺多出一堆細碎紀錄。⟦好比花園裡的定時灑水器每次巡檢只看當下狀態，以前每巡一回就印一張日報表塞滿信箱，現在預設巡完直接收工，想對帳時再撥開關逐趟留單。⟧現在工作階段佔用的磁碟空間變少了。負責追蹤目標的 `goal-reminder` 與負責確認結果的 `verify-reminder` 兩款提醒外掛，都不再為每次檢查單獨儲存紀錄檔。如果你還想保留這些紀錄，只要打開 `settings.json` 設定檔，將 `plugins.goal-reminder.child_session_log` 與 `plugins.verify-reminder.child_session_log` 設為 `"retained"` 即可：

```json
{
  "plugins": {
    "goal-reminder": {
      "child_session_log": "retained"
    },
    "verify-reminder": {
      "child_session_log": "retained"
    }
  }
}
```

body.en:
When running a long task and repeatedly checking progress, small log records often pile up on your drive without you noticing. ⟦A timed garden sprinkler only checks the current state on each round; it used to print a daily report every single pass and stuff the mailbox, whereas now it finishes the round and clocks out by default unless you flip a switch to keep each trip's slip when you want to reconcile later.⟧ Sessions now take up less disk space. Both `goal-reminder`, which tracks goals, and `verify-reminder`, which verifies results, no longer save a separate log file for each check. If you still want to keep these logs, open your `settings.json` file and set `plugins.goal-reminder.child_session_log` and `plugins.verify-reminder.child_session_log` to `"retained"`:

```json
{
  "plugins": {
    "goal-reminder": {
      "child_session_log": "retained"
    },
    "verify-reminder": {
      "child_session_log": "retained"
    }
  }
}
```
